  ('Bir öğrenci \'She is a very success businesswoman.\' yazmıştır. Doğru biçim hangisidir?', 'She is a very successful businesswoman.', ['She is a very succeed businesswoman.', 'She is a very successive businesswoman.', 'She is a very successly businesswoman.'], 'İsmi nitelemek için sıfat gerekir: success → successful.'),
